{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":363041,\"title\":\"Ghoul Quest\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"Serafim is a vampire hunter - who wanders through Macedonian villages and destroys the vampired dead man for money. His apprentice is young fellow named Fidan, who Serafim teaches the rough and dangerous vampire craft, along with the alphabet and the insecure life in Macedonia. Vampire man and his student in their surroundings get in struggle with: Macedonian vampires, Turkish Authority and with Komiti (Macedonian Revolutionaries), also with Avdzi - Taburi (paid hunters of Komiti). Fidan experiences damnation of the vampire skill, who doesn't know if Serafim is a God's angel or servant of Devil.\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/o1tgqTvAYNJCUFRncKk8aLBicsh.jpg\",\"backdrop\":null,\"rating\":9,\"voteCount\":1,\"year\":2002,\"runtime\":66,\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Drama\",\"Fantasy\"],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"MK\",\"name\":\"Macedonia\"}],\"budget\":0,\"revenue\":0,\"director\":\"Goran Trenchovski\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":1520117,\"name\":\"Goran Trenchovski\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1364580,\"name\":\"Petar Temelkovski\",\"character\":\"Vampirdžijata\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1520119,\"name\":\"Robert Veljanovski\",\"character\":\"Fidan\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1177693,\"name\":\"Petar Arsovski\",\"character\":\"Gorazd\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/3dL4XfpvcSTpXoGrM3zdygLU3Lc.jpg\"},{\"id\":1485882,\"name\":\"Mustafa Jašar\",\"character\":\"Juzbašijata\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1171062,\"name\":\"Senko Velinov\",\"character\":\"Džemšit\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1520120,\"name\":\"Branko Gjorchev\",\"character\":\"Angele\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1520121,\"name\":\"Aleksandra Peševska\",\"character\":\"Angelina\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/bSwtrIpyPWHZ0RmgmNgybR39tnX.jpg\"},{\"id\":1520122,\"name\":\"Krste Jovanovski\",\"character\":\"Vasilie\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1520123,\"name\":\"Zorica Pančić\",\"character\":\"Vasilija\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1520124,\"name\":\"Tome Vitanov\",\"character\":\"Efrem\",\"photo\":null}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":1567605,\"title\":\"Ebenezer\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6H2N59jJW1hZEzn2ZdrMvJw5vNI.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/274ahmbkJSzdmcWrWSTu9DFv5rp.jpg\",\"rating\":7.5,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"An elderly miser embarks on a supernatural journey after visits from the ghost of his former business partner and the Spirits of Christmas Past, Present, and Yet to Come force him to confront his past and fight for a second chance at happiness.\",\"genres\":[\"Fantasy\",\"Drama\",\"Horror\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1062722,\"title\":\"Frankenstein\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/g4JtvGlQO7DByTI6frUobqvSL3R.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hpXBJxLD2SEf8l2CspmSeiHrBKX.jpg\",\"rating\":7.6,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Dr. Victor Frankenstein, a brilliant but egotistical scientist, brings a creature to life in a monstrous experiment that ultimately leads to the undoing of both the creator and his tragic creation.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Fantasy\",\"Horror\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":10253,\"title\":\"Dragon Wars: D-War\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/rEpvqWGu08coDLUpcpiz4sMoDYo.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5WWqrUIGrCb1QvZtYVaSfZgUG8n.jpg\",\"rating\":4.6,\"year\":2007,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Ethan learns he carries the spirit of a warrior who battled dragons in 16th-century Korea -- and one day he'll find a tattooed girl carrying the spirit of that warrior's beloved. Years later, he meets Sarah and dragons soon descend on Los Angeles seeking out the two souls of the ancient lovers.\",\"genres\":[\"Fantasy\",\"Drama\",\"Horror\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":590995,\"title\":\"The Craft: Legacy\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/lhMIra0pqWNuD6CIXoTmGwZ0EBS.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jb8pEmjgmUlJI3Llbb9x75ZlJ03.jpg\",\"rating\":6.1,\"year\":2020,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"An eclectic foursome of aspiring teenage witches get more than they bargained for as they lean into their newfound powers.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Drama\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1433,\"title\":\"The Devil's Backbone\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/iP1z1aJzPnkP8FHg77TS7ukqoEZ.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bjF9mcP7IuD4x01T7W70gKzSkxx.jpg\",\"rating\":7.3,\"year\":2001,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Spain, 1939. In the last days of the Spanish Civil War, the young Carlos arrives at the Santa Lucía orphanage, where he will make friends and enemies as he follows the quiet footsteps of a mysterious presence eager for revenge.\",\"genres\":[\"Fantasy\",\"Drama\",\"Horror\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":527261,\"title\":\"The Silence\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/k6zhpMq1D18PfO2DEauqF9CTTnb.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/C0LeSBENga7jb9QTiVjqNEbMhU.jpg\",\"rating\":6,\"year\":2019,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"With the world under attack by deadly creatures who hunt by sound, a teen and her family seek refuge outside the city and encounter a mysterious cult.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Drama\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":836225,\"title\":\"The Exorcism of God\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/hangTmbxpSV4gpHG7MgSlCWSSFa.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mjIuTXM4FhLAT1apxHULetAZAfj.jpg\",\"rating\":7.1,\"year\":2022,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"An American priest working in Mexico is considered a saint by many local parishioners. However, due to a botched exorcism, he carries a secret that’s eating him alive until he gets an opportunity to face his demon one final time.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Crime\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":301804,\"title\":\"Before I Wake\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/sI9neTbF3ECdpf2MpC88EMGJH13.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xPbm6DJCn26NHvRwsuG9eGC0b3y.jpg\",\"rating\":6.5,\"year\":2016,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"An orphaned child's dreams—and nightmares—manifest physically as he sleeps.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Fantasy\",\"Horror\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":788929,\"title\":\"Lamb\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/gP9yviboTGWGolqUZKIB1UkF1C2.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/96uOMED23ZLBtb0HQQ5Urr3qMRp.jpg\",\"rating\":6.4,\"year\":2021,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"An Icelandic couple live with their herd of sheep on a beautiful but remote farm. When they discover a mysterious newborn on their land, they decide to keep it and raise it as their own. This unexpected development and the prospects of a new family brings them much joy before ultimately destroying them.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Fantasy\",\"Horror\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":926899,\"title\":\"The House\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xhE1EYcD6U7m5R8AT7yf29CCxia.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hk4PwhKhT7q7jp1lvA8aiYqDluy.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"year\":2022,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Across different eras, a poor family, an anxious developer and a fed-up landlady become tied to the same mysterious house in this animated dark comedy.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Drama\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":299824,\"title\":\"Mojin: The Lost Legend\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/supoIHkh3dzDi1XmvK8tgGlkGNS.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/us0mTpTmGCDboPpgddjcw6nYPQH.jpg\",\"rating\":6.2,\"year\":2015,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Three tomb raiders retire from their roles and move to New York to enjoy the rest of their lives. However, they are asked to resume duty in order to find out the reason behind the loss of a loved one.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":340176,\"title\":\"Tag\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/1xqQv9PoOIVX4nHlKVQELaAHyvG.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rch5tr1bpNyfeRJxARoU7I2a9KR.jpg\",\"rating\":6.4,\"year\":2015,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"As the sole survivor of a horrendous and rather mysterious accident, teenage Mitsuko's day is off to a bad start. An unstoppable force of nature, a doomed field trip, and a strange case of amnesia easily coexist in a bizarre parallel universe, where a desperate Mitsuko is always on the run from something inexplicable, intangible, and utterly deadly. However, amid piles of fresh corpses, mounds of scorching bullet shells, and rivulets of fragrant adolescent blood, Mitsuko must fight to stay alive, before her already messed-up day becomes even stranger. But one question still remains: who or what is the enemy?\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Action\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"zg0N4L4mwFk\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"b75-lgs3cMM\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"WAUG5G3VwT0\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}